-- --opens specification (seg/WRITING.md, rule 6) for TripleMaps
-- (doc/postnikov-morphisms.pdf, Section 2 (Lemmas ptpath, transl, fac, at-point, unique-fac, key)): one entry per declaration.  Generated from
-- --opened (28 Oct 2026); the openings were audited against the note by kind
-- (below), not entry by entry.
-- Kinds:
--   the notions of the text, opened by definition where a statement is about them
--     (PtMap / PtSec, ptcomp, ptid, Fib / fpt / fpr, Triple.F / f0, Mor, mor-a/b/H,
--     ck, kc, the local names of the modules: P, Q, T, Fam, MY, Z, G, Tl, Dist, ...);
--   the "by definition" steps of the note: FibMap.fm and its components ff, fu, fv,
--     hs, c, fm-fun in realise-map-def (realise-map is Dec of (K(a,2), Phi(K(b,4), H))
--     by definition), in sq-at and in the Paste / FmId lemmas; Transl.tau, Transl.Tl;
--     Equivalences.compose and Fibres.sigma-equiv where a composite equivalence is
--     identified with the map of the text (E.homotopy with refl); the calc of
--     FibMap.fm-pt-q (Prelude.trans, trans-cancel) in Dec.piq-equiv;
--     PtMapLoops.ev / FT.tr / subst in loop0 (ev refl = r by definition);
--     the pointing of Maps.loop (D, loop) in to-loop; hcl, HC, STr.C, Quot.Q/image
--     (classes are the inc of STr), Bijection.Fibre; Phi, H4, Psi.psi;
--   statements about a construction open its outer layer only: Lev.conj, eAi, eBi and
--     Climb.unconj in Coef.unconj-conj; H2.inv2, hom-of, Climb.inv3, inv4 in inv2-K ..
--     inv4-K; KFun.Comp.Stmt in kc-lev; Deloopable, fibO, P4 (the hypothesis dl);
--   index arithmetic: two, three, four, five, NatArith.plus, isConn, isTrunc;
--   extras, not steps of the text: the aliases KZ2 / kz2 / KZ4 / kz4 against
--     KK[Z].K two / four (as in mapfib.opens, markdirect.opens).
-- No construction of K(h, m), e_m, the delooping or the cup square is opened.
-- Check: segd All.seg --opens triplemaps.opens ; every line "nothing else opened".
